  'p_the_uvex_silv_air_e7000_defends_against_dust_and_aerosols_p_ul_li_reusable_p3_cartridges_provide_certified_filtration_performance_li_li_optimised_exhalation_valve_reduces_breathing_resistance_li_li_soft_sealing_straps_maintain_a_reliable_seal_for_active_crews_li_ul' => '<p>The uvex Silv-Air e 7000 defends against dust and aerosols.</p><ul><li>reusable P3 cartridges provide certified filtration performance.</li><li>optimised exhalation valve reduces breathing resistance.</li><li>soft sealing straps maintain a reliable seal for active crews.</li></ul>',
  'p_the_uvex_uvex1_g2_boot_endures_rugged_baltic_job_sites_p_ul_li_s3_protection_meets_toe_cap_and_puncture_standards_li_li_micro_velour_upper_combines_durability_with_weather_resistance_li_li_pu_i_pu_sole_paired_with_climate_control_lining_keeps_footing_secure_and_feet_warm_li_ul' => '<p>The uvex Uvex 1 G2 boot endures rugged Baltic job sites.</p><ul><li>S3 protection meets toe-cap and puncture standards.</li><li>micro-velour upper combines durability with weather resistance.</li><li>PU/i-PU sole paired with climate control lining keeps footing secure and feet warm.</li></ul>',
  'p_the_uvex_uvex2_xenova_boot_endures_rugged_baltic_job_sites_p_ul_li_s1p_protection_meets_toe_cap_and_puncture_standards_li_li_perforated_microfibre_combines_durability_with_weather_resistance_li_li_xenova_pu_tpu_sole_paired_with_distance_mesh_lining_keeps_footing_secure_and_feet_warm_li_ul' => '<p>The uvex Uvex 2 xenova boot endures rugged Baltic job sites.</p><ul><li>S1P protection meets toe-cap and puncture standards.</li><li>perforated microfibre combines durability with weather resistance.</li><li>xenova PU/TPU sole paired with distance mesh lining keeps footing secure and feet warm.</li></ul>',
  'p_the_uvex_uvex_heckel_maccross_boot_endures_rugged_baltic_job_sites_p_ul_li_s5_protection_meets_toe_cap_and_puncture_standards_li_li_polyurethane_boot_combines_durability_with_weather_resistance_li_li_self_cleaning_pu_sole_paired_with_textile_lining_keeps_footing_secure_and_feet_warm_li_ul' => '<p>The uvex Uvex Heckel MacCross boot endures rugged Baltic job sites.</p><ul><li>S5 protection meets toe-cap and puncture standards.</li><li>polyurethane boot combines durability with weather resistance.</li><li>self-cleaning PU sole paired with textile lining keeps footing secure and feet warm.</li></ul>',
  'p_triple_layer_membrane_resists_uv_wind_uplift_and_heavy_rain_during_installation_p_p_self_sealing_laps_shorten_installation_time_on_steep_pitches_p' => '<p>Triple-layer membrane resists UV, wind uplift, and heavy rain during installation.</p><p>Self-sealing laps shorten installation time on steep pitches.</p>',
